      },
      "imageFile": "category-fresh-vegetables.jpg",
      "description": {
        "en": "Leafy greens, gourds, roots, and seasonal vegetables picked for color, firmness, and clean cuts—ideal for everyday Bengali cooking and lighter plates.\n\nWe rotate with harvest windows in Bangladesh and keep profiles honest: you will see how each item is sold (by net kg or by typical bunch) in the line description.",
